<title>USA: GTECH to supply Mass. State Lottery.</title>
<headline>GTECH to supply Mass. State Lottery.</headline>
<dateline>WEST GREENWHICH, R.I. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTECH Holdings Corp said on Tuesday it would provide online equipment and software for the Massachusetts State Lottery under a contract signed between Digital Equipment Corp and the state.</p>
<p>The company said it also had fresh agreements to provide online services and equipment for existing lottery customers in Kansas and Sweden.</p>
<p>GTECH, a subcontractor to Digital, declined comment on the value of contracts.</p>
</text>
